    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
